# Local-only artifacts (see AGENTS.md): rebuilt binary and its editor backups,
# the local usage history snapshot, the Clash watchdog's read-only config, and
# MCP browser scratch dirs. The usage-history patterns are wildcards on
# purpose: SaveUsageHistory also leaves <config>.usage.history.json.replace,
# .usage.history.json.corrupt.<unixnano>/.oversized.<unixnano> keeps, and
# .usage-history-*.tmp scratch files, and the config name is operator-chosen.
